    "detailed_description": "<strong>Fingerdance</strong> is a finger-twister that tests your dexterity.<br><br>Place five fingers of any hand comfortably on your keyboard. You have to press and release each finger according to the given patterns. It\u2019s a bit like a rhythm game\u2014but there\u2019s no need to match the beats precisely. Take your time!<br><br>The faster you complete each pattern, the higher your rank will be. Try getting an S-rank on every stage!",
